cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with MOSE."
title: "MOSE-GPU: the GPU version of MOSE"
abstract: >-
  The GPU version of MOSE, an open-source compressible flow solver for the Euler
  and Navier-Stokes equations on multi-block structured grids: the same
  equations, numerical methods and input files, with every kernel of the time
  step on NVIDIA GPUs (OpenACC and CUDA Fortran) and one GPU per MPI rank.
